      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, the weather today is very good today! Let’s go out!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我在睡觉，不想去。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我在睡覺，不想去。",
